# DeltaOS is built on Linux, but the repository is often edited on Windows.
# Without this file, Git for Windows with core.autocrlf=true checks the tree out
# with CRLF line endings, and every shell hook, YAML file and QML slideshow then
# fails on the build machine ("bad interpreter: /bin/bash^M").
* text=auto eol=lf

# Explicit binary types: never convert or diff these as text.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
